WEBVTT

00:06:58.196 --> 00:07:01.349
uploaded by civil rights activists
or citizen journalists?

00:07:02.048 --> 00:07:05.270
The content moderators
often decide on such cases

00:07:05.294 --> 00:07:08.027
at the same speed as the [clear] cases.

00:07:09.515 --> 00:07:12.174
MR: We will show you a video now,

00:07:12.198 --> 00:07:15.507
and we would like to ask you to decide:

00:07:15.531 --> 00:07:17.221
Would you delete it,

00:07:17.245 --> 00:07:19.046
or would you not delete it?

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.737
(Video) (Air strike sounds)

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.650
(Explosion)

00:07:28.076 --> 00:07:34.029
(People speaking in Arabic)